---
mm: 1.2
kind: sdk
name: pico-arm
target: arm-none-eabi
compiler-family: gcc
runtime: newlib
library: pico-sdk
provides: reset-vector
provides: initial-stack
provides: memory-layout
provides: runtime-init
provides: syscalls
platform-provider: mm.mcu platform.pico.mcu
platform-provider: mm.stdio platform.pico.stdio
---

# Pico SDK Arm platform

The external Pico SDK build owns the complete bare-metal platform and the final
link. It supplies GPIO, buses, UART, and time through platform.pico.mcu and a
USB CDC console through platform.pico.stdio.
